  <h1 class="mb-5 mt-0 font-serif text-4xl font-semibold leading-tight text-base-content sm:text-[2.8rem]">Alex Rowan</h1>

  <div class="answer-first">
    <span class="af-label">About</span>
    <p><strong>Alex Rowan researches and writes the redemption-time and payout coverage on Social Casino Index.</strong> He has worked as an analyst in the iGaming industry for the past 6 years, focusing on compliance. Every article carries a byline, a published date, and a last-updated date, and every factual claim traces to a listed source. Contact: <a href="mailto:alex@socialcasinoindex.com">alex@socialcasinoindex.com</a> · <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alex-williams-464708435/" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a></p>
  </div>

  <h2>Background</h2>
  <p>Alex has worked as an analyst in the iGaming industry for the past 6 years, focusing on compliance. That background shapes how this site reads operator terms: effective dates, eligibility rules, verification requirements, and redemption restrictions are checked against the source documents, not marketing pages.</p>

  <h2>What Alex covers</h2>
  <ul class="tick-list">
    <li>Reading operator terms of service and recording effective and access dates.</li>
    <li>Running funded redemption tests under the site <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>.</li>
    <li>Writing and maintaining the research articles listed below.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>How the work is done</h2>
  <p>Research on this site follows the published <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>: accounts are funded with the site's own money, redemptions are requested as an ordinary player, and each stage is timed from request to funds received. Where a figure comes from an operator's published terms rather than a completed funded test, it is labeled as such. The site does not invent credentials, employers, or personal testing history; figures that have not been measured are marked pending or unverified.</p>

  <h2>Review and update policy</h2>
  <p>Every article is reviewed before publication. Material corrections are recorded with a date in the article's change log when one is present, and the "last updated" date reflects the most recent material review. Articles are re-checked as new operator research is completed.</p>

  <h2>Disclosures</h2>
  <p>Some articles contain affiliate links. Compensation never affects a rating, a ranking or a measured figure. Full details on the <a href="/disclosure/">disclosure page</a>.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions, corrections and operator terms updates: <a href="mailto:alex@socialcasinoindex.com">alex@socialcasinoindex.com</a>. General site enquiries: <a href="mailto:contact@socialcasinoindex.com">contact@socialcasinoindex.com</a>. Alex is also on <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/alex-williams-464708435/" rel="me noopener" target="_blank">LinkedIn</a>.</p>

